      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another problem is that people can request invite to a Friends Only instance when they're not the friend of the instance owner. \n\nThis creates a very clunky series of events usually where you either ignore the invite or have to figure out who started the instance, then ask them to add the user wanting in.  This is made even worse by people with hard-to-search names or unicode characters.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d0cd9f44eb72c0c8abc5fb5",
